Atech Atelier — third-party components added by Atech
=====================================================

This file covers what Atech adds on top of the upstream FreeCAD AppImage.
FreeCAD itself and the libraries it bundles are covered by
  usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/LICENSE.html
  usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/ThirdPartyLibraries.html
and by the source offer in usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/SOURCE_OFFER.txt.

FreeCADMCP (the FreeCAD addon half of freecad-mcp)
  upstream  https://github.com/neka-nat/freecad-mcp
  commit    @FREECADMCP_COMMIT@
  licence   MIT — Copyright (c) 2025 Shirokuma (k tanaka)
  installed usr/Mod/FreeCADMCP/
  licence text usr/Mod/FreeCADMCP/LICENSE and
               usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.FreeCADMCP
  MODIFIED BY ATECH. The patches applied to this copy are installed, as
  applied, in usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/FreeCADMCP-patches/.

Lucide icons
  upstream  https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
  licence   ISC — Copyright (c) Lucide Icons and Contributors
  used in   a small set of icon path strings inlined in
            usr/Mod/AcadAgent/acadagent/style.py (PATHS)
  licence text usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.Lucide
               (fetched at lucide commit 66d8f9fc394b8530377e5f6112f0b8908ba01280)

Feather icons
  upstream  https://github.com/feathericons/feather
  licence   MIT — Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole Bemis
  used in   Lucide icons derived from Feather (the Lucide licence lists
            them), inlined the same way
  licence text usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/third_party/LICENSE.Feather
               (fetched at feather commit 3dc050d97405062eba78aa57115c0a15c63abdaa)

Upstream components Atech's code relies on directly
  (shipped by FreeCAD, not added by Atech; listed so the dependency is
  visible. Full list with versions: CREDITS.md, installed as
  usr/share/doc/@DOC_NAME@/CREDITS.md.)

fcgear (FreeCAD PartDesign involute gear generator)
  upstream  https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD (src/Mod/PartDesign/fcgear)
  licence   LGPL-2.0-or-later — (c) 2014 David Douard, (c) 2023 Jonas Bähr
  installed usr/Mod/PartDesign/fcgear/ (part of FreeCAD, unmodified)
  used in   the agent kit's spur_gear() (usr/Mod/AcadAgent/acadagent/agent_kit/
            atech_cad.py) imports it; nothing is copied from it
  licence text header of usr/Mod/PartDesign/fcgear/involute.py and
               usr/share/doc/FreeCAD/LICENSE.html

DejaVu fonts (DejaVuSans.ttf)
  upstream  https://dejavu-fonts.github.io
  licence   Bitstream Vera Fonts licence; DejaVu changes are public domain;
            Arev glyphs (c) Tavmjong Bah
  installed usr/fonts/DejaVuSans.ttf ("Version 2.37", shipped by FreeCAD);
            the build sandbox prefers the host system's copy when present
  used in   the one font path the build sandbox gives model scripts for
            text on parts (usr/Mod/AcadAgent/acadagent/sandbox.py)
  licence text usr/lib/python3.11/site-packages/matplotlib/mpl-data/fonts/ttf/
               LICENSE_DEJAVU

bubblewrap (bwrap) — NOT bundled
  upstream  https://github.com/containers/bubblewrap
  licence   LGPL-2.0-or-later
  used in   build isolation, run from the host system when installed
            (sandbox.py); absent, builds run with weaker isolation and the
            app says so

Claude Code (the `claude` CLI) — NOT bundled, NOT open source
  vendor    Anthropic, https://claude.com/claude-code
  licence   proprietary, Anthropic's terms
  used in   the chat panel runs the user's own installed copy
